# PR self-review reports (regenerated per branch by the pr-self-review skill)
.claude/pr-self-review/

# Development plans written by the implementation-planner subagent when a task has no spec
# (local, reused across sessions); plans for a spec live beside it as specs/<slug>/plan.md
.claude/plans/

# Task inbox: materials for the current task, picked up by /dev-flow and /spec (only the README is tracked)
inbox/*
!inbox/README.md
